The `HashedAttackName` method hashes a string using SHA-256 and then maps portions of the hashed string to specific attacks. If any of the attack names are present within the hash, they will be executed. 

Please note that you need to handle XML parsing errors and ensure your XML file is well formed for this code to work correctly.
